<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Avis maiden results just ahead of forecast.</title>
<headline>Avis maiden results just ahead of forecast.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   35.95	 vs 27.50</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     35.16	 vs 27.50</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 8.09	  vs 5.24</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   44.50	 vs 34.63</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   70.58	 vs 55.68</p>
